---

## 1. Purpose

Ship a **production-grade** mobile-first landing at `denali.club/` (dev: `denali.localhost:3002/`) that converts guests to `/tours` → portal register. MVP is **4 blocks**; quality bar is **merge blockers + cutover + measurable perf**.

### 1.1 Goals

- Cinematic Denali hero (gradient + optional hero image)
- Up to 6 **latest** published tours (catalog sort — not curated featured)
- Trust from **real** tenant branding only
- Repeat CTA band
- Multi-tenant safe (Urban/guest-club not broken)
- Full test + CI coverage for `/`

### 1.2 Non-goals (this release)

| Item | Reason |
|------|--------|
| `/tours` list redesign | Separate track |
| Tour detail page | Separate track |
| Portal registration UX | portal-registration-ui.md |
| Stats / fake metrics | Legal/trust |
| Category bento without API filter | Misleading |
| FAQ / gallery / why-us | Post-MVP backlog |
| Full mobile drawer / footer | Post-MVP |

**Merge blocker (not optional):** PR-0 SDK `guestLanding` + `resolveGuestLandingFeatures` — see §18. No `pluginId === "denali"` in `apps/marketing`.

