## 3. Architecture

### 3.0 Enterprise rule (ADR-MKT-004)

`apps/marketing` **must not** branch on `pluginId === "denali"` (or any workspace literal). Landing variant comes from:

```typescript
import { resolveGuestLandingFeatures } from "@app-tour/workspace-sdk";

const landing = resolveGuestLandingFeatures(bootstrap.pluginId);
// landing.variant: "full" | "minimal"
// landing.sections.* — booleans + latestToursLimit
// landing.i18nProfile — "full" | "minimal"
```

Same pattern as `resolveCatalogListFeatures` · [`marketing-catalog-ui.md`](./marketing-catalog-ui.md) § SDK resolver registry.

### 3.1 Component tree (RSC-first)

```text
app/layout.tsx
  MarketingShell (header — brand → /)
  └── app/page.tsx (RSC, force-dynamic)
        ├── isPlatformMotherHost → platform home (UNCHANGED)
        ├── resolveMarketingBootstrapForHost(host)
        ├── resolveGuestLandingFeatures(bootstrap.pluginId)
        ├── fetchPublicTenantBrandingForHost(host)   # deduped fetch w/ layout
        ├── fetchHomeCatalogItems({ landing, ...bootstrap })  # if any catalog-backed section
        └── renderHomePage({ landing, branding, catalogItems, pluginId })

renderHomePage:
  landing.variant === "full"  → GuestHomeFull
  landing.variant === "minimal" → GuestHomeMinimal

GuestHomeFull (page order):
  <main data-marketing-home>
    {hero && <HomeHero showSearch={heroSearch} />}
    {featured && <HomeFeatured items />}
    {latest && <HomeLatestTours items />}
    {categories && <HomeCategories categories />}
    {destinations && <HomeDestinations />}
    {trust && <HomeTrust />}
    {whySection && <HomeWhy />}
    {journey && <HomeJourney />}
    {testimonials && <HomeTestimonials />}
    {faq && <HomeFaq />}
    {finalCta && <HomeFinalCta />}
  </main>

GuestHomeMinimal:
  <main data-marketing-home>
    <h1 data-marketing-home-title>…</h1>
    <p data-marketing-home-lead>…</p>   # optional per manifest
    <Link data-marketing-home-cta href="/tours" />
  </main>
```

**Naming:** no `Denali*` components in `apps/marketing/src` — workspace-agnostic `GuestHome*`.

**Client boundaries:** max **1** — `HomeLatestTours` only if CSS scroll-snap insufficient.

### 3.2 Data flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant Browser
  participant Page as page.tsx RSC
  participant SDK as resolveGuestLandingFeatures
  participant Brand as GET /public/tenant-branding
  participant Cat as fetchCatalogList

  Browser->>Page: GET /
  Page->>SDK: pluginId
  SDK-->>Page: landing sections
  Page->>Brand: displayName logoUrl
  alt sections need catalog (latest / featured / categories)
    Page->>Cat: tenantId pluginId limit=max(...)
    alt OK
      Cat-->>Page: items[]
    else error/empty
      Cat-->>Page: []
    end
  else minimal
    Page-->>Page: skip catalog
  end
  Page-->>Browser: HTML 200
```

### 3.3 Failure matrix

| Failure | Behavior | HTTP |
|---------|----------|------|
| Catalog fetch throws | Hide latest/featured/categories blocks; log warn | 200 |
| Catalog empty | Hide latest/featured/categories blocks | 200 |
| Branding fetch fails | Fallback i18n site name | 200 |
| Unknown pluginId (no manifest) | `UnknownGuestLandingPluginError` thrown — **fail-closed** (same as `UnknownCatalogPresentationPluginError`) | propagates to Next error boundary |
| Mother host | Platform home | 200 |
| Maintenance surface | MaintenancePage (layout) | 200 |

**Policy:** No silent fallback to `GuestHomeMinimal` for unknown plugins. New workspace **must** declare `guestLanding` in manifest before marketing deploy. Resolver tests (SDK-HOME-03) enforce throw.

Never 500 on `/` for downstream **catalog** errors only (catalog fail-soft §3.4).

### 3.4 Fetch contract (page.tsx)

```typescript
const bootstrap = await resolveMarketingBootstrapForHost(host);
const landing = resolveGuestLandingFeatures(bootstrap.pluginId);

const catalogItems = await fetchHomeCatalogItems({
  landing,
  tenantId: bootstrap.tenantId,
  pluginId: bootstrap.pluginId,
  fetchCatalogList,
});
```

**Limit:** `resolveHomeCatalogFetchLimit(landing)` = `max(latestToursLimit, featuredToursLimit, 12 when categories)`.

**Skip fetch:** when no catalog-backed section is enabled (HOME-UNIT-04).

**Cache:** same `buildMarketingCatalogCacheTag(tenantId)` as `/tours` — home refreshes on catalog revalidate.

