## 4. Section specifications

### 4.1 Hero

| Attribute | Value |
|-----------|-------|
| Hook root | `data-marketing-home-hero` |
| Title hook | `data-marketing-home-title` — `{displayName}` or i18n template |
| Lead hook | `data-marketing-home-lead` |
| CTA hook | `data-marketing-home-cta` → `/tours` |
| Min height mobile | `min(70vh, 32rem)` |
| Min height desktop | `min(80vh, 40rem)` |
| Background | `public/home/hero.webp` OR CSS gradient fallback |
| Text color | `#fff` on gradient overlay ≥4.5:1 |
| CTA mobile | full-width, min-height 2.75rem |
| CTA style | `--color-accent` bg |

**Acceptance:** 375px RTL · no overflow-x · hooks present · works without image file.

### 4.2 Latest published tours (not curated «featured»)

| Attribute | Value |
|-----------|-------|
| Hook | `data-marketing-home-latest` |
| Data | `fetchCatalogList({ ...bootstrap, limit })` — **first N by catalog sort** |
| Semantics | «Latest / recent published» — **no** pinned/featured API in MVP |
| Hidden when | `items.length === 0` or `sections.latestTours === false` |
| Layout mobile | horizontal scroll-snap, card 85vw |
| Layout ≥1024px | 3-column grid (optional) |
| Card hook | `data-marketing-home-latest-card` per item (do not reuse list card hook on home) |
| View all | Link `/tours` with i18n `home.latest.viewAll` |

**Card fields:** `coverImageUrl`, `title`, `listSubtitle`, dates via `buildCatalogTourMetaLine`, `priceAmount` if `showListPrice`, link `/tours/{id}`.

**Acceptance:** shows seeded published tour on operator/denali dev host · hidden when empty · label must not imply editorial curation.

### 4.3 Trust

| Attribute | Value |
|-----------|-------|
| Hook | `data-marketing-home-trust` |
| Data | `branding.logoUrl`, `branding.displayName` |
| Copy | i18n `home.trust.tagline` — **no invented numbers** |
| Icon | Lucide `ShieldCheck` or `Mountain` (1.25rem) |

**Acceptance:** logo alt="" decorative if duplicate text present · no stats.

### 4.4 Final CTA

| Attribute | Value |
|-----------|-------|
| Hook | `data-marketing-home-final-cta` |
| Style | full-width band `--color-accent` |
| CTA | same label as hero primary → `/tours` |

### 4.5 Discovery (PR-7)

| Section | Hook | Data / behavior |
|---------|------|-----------------|
| Hero search | `data-marketing-home-search` | GET form → `/tours?q=` |
| Featured bento | `data-marketing-home-featured` | First N catalog items (same sort as latest); bento layout only |
| Categories | `data-marketing-home-categories` | Unique `category` from fetched cards; links → `/tours?category=` |
| Destinations | `data-marketing-home-destinations` | Static i18n seed (`alborz`, `damavand`, `zardkuh`) → `/tours?q=` |

**Fetch:** one `fetchHomeCatalogItems` call; limit = `max(latestToursLimit, featuredToursLimit, 12 if categories)`.

**List filter:** `/tours` applies `filterMarketingCatalogItems` client-side for `q` and `category` (no API param yet).

### 4.6 Premium (PR-8)

| Section | Hook | Data / behavior |
|---------|------|-----------------|
| Gallery | `data-marketing-home-gallery` | Unique tour `coverImageUrl` from catalog (max 8) |
| Equipment | `data-marketing-home-equipment` | Static i18n checklist |
| Blog teaser | `data-marketing-home-blog` | Stub when `blogTeaser` true (CMS later) |
| Home JSON-LD | `data-marketing-home-jsonld` | ItemList from latest tour slice |
| Skip link | `data-marketing-skip-link` | Full landing → `#main-content` |
| Hero image | `--mkt-hero-image` on hero | Optional `marketingHeroUrl` from branding API |

