## 7. i18n contract

File: `apps/marketing/messages/{fa,en}/catalog.json`

### 7.1 Key tree (required)

Two profiles — resolver picks subtree via `landing.i18nProfile`:

**`home.full.*`** (denali `variant: full` only):

| Key | fa (draft) | en (draft) |
|-----|------------|------------|
| `home.full.hero.lead` | برنامه‌های کوهنوردی و طبیعت‌گردی منتشرشده | Published mountain and nature programs |
| `home.full.hero.ctaPrimary` | مشاهده تورها | Browse tours |
| `home.full.latest.title` | آخرین برنامه‌های منتشرشده | Latest published programs |
| `home.full.latest.viewAll` | همه تورها | View all tours |
| `home.full.trust.tagline` | باشگاه کوهنوردی · برنامه‌ریزی و ایمنی | Hiking club · planned and safe trips |
| `home.full.finalCta.title` | آماده سفر بعدی؟ | Ready for your next trip? |
| `home.full.finalCta.cta` | مشاهده تورها | Browse tours |

**`home.minimal.*`** (urban · guest-club):

| Key | fa | en |
|-----|----|----|
| `home.minimal.title` | {siteName} | {siteName} |
| `home.minimal.lead` | مشاهده برنامه‌های منتشرشده | View published programs |
| `home.minimal.cta` | مشاهده تورها | Browse tours |

**Shared:** Hero/minimal title uses `branding.displayName ?? t("nav.defaultSiteName")` — not a static mountain title.

### 7.2 SEO keys (manifest-driven)

Add to `guestSeo.marketing` per workspace (like `listTitleKey`):

| Manifest field | denali example | urban example |
|----------------|----------------|---------------|
| `homeTitleKey` | `seo.homeTitle` | `seo.homeTitle` |
| `homeDescriptionKey` | `seo.homeDescription` | `seo.homeDescription` |

`generateMetadata` reads via `resolveGuestSeoForPlugin(pluginId).marketing.homeTitleKey`.

### 7.3 Legacy aliases (remove after smoke green)

| Legacy | Replacement |
|--------|-------------|
| `home.title` | displayName injection |
| `home.lead` | `home.full.hero.lead` or `home.minimal.lead` |
| `home.browseTours` | `home.full.hero.ctaPrimary` or `home.minimal.cta` |

**HOME-UNIT-02:** fa/en key parity under `home.full.*` and `home.minimal.*`.

