## 8. CSS contract

File: `packages/workspaces/denali/theme/denali-marketing.css`

Scope: `body[data-app-surface="marketing"][data-workspace-plugin="denali"]`

### 8.1 New selectors (minimum)

```text
[data-marketing-home]
[data-marketing-home-hero]
[data-marketing-home-title]
[data-marketing-home-lead]
[data-marketing-home-cta]
[data-marketing-home-latest]
[data-marketing-home-latest-card]
[data-marketing-home-trust]
[data-marketing-home-final-cta]
```

### 8.2 Tokens (use existing `--mkt-*`)

| Token | Use |
|-------|-----|
| `--mkt-text-display` | hero H1 |
| `--mkt-text-body` | lead |
| `--space-8` | section gap |
| `--mkt-shadow-card` | latest tour cards |
| `--mkt-border-width` | borders |

**Rule:** no raw px for spacing/type · `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` on transforms.

### 8.3 CSS migration (PR-1 blocker)

**Remove** (dead after hero restructure):

```text
header[data-marketing-home-header]   # in denali-marketing.css + urban-marketing.css
```

**Add** in `denali-marketing.css` only (full variant):

```text
section[data-marketing-home-hero]     # min-height, gradient overlay, white text
[data-marketing-home-latest]          # scroll-snap row
[data-marketing-home-latest-card]
[data-marketing-home-trust]
[data-marketing-home-final-cta]       # accent band full-bleed
```

**Urban minimal:** keep existing `main[data-marketing-home]` + title/lead/cta rules; **no** hero/latest/trust/final CSS until P16.

**Hero lead color:** on hero overlay use `#fff` / `rgba(255,255,255,0.9)` — not `--muted-foreground`.

**CTA mobile:** `width: 100%` inside hero · `min-height: 2.75rem`.

