## 15. PR strategy

| PR | Scope | Merge blocker | Tests |
|----|-------|---------------|-------|
| **PR-0** | SDK `guestLanding` manifest + generator + `resolveGuestLandingFeatures` + `guestSeo.home*` keys | **Yes — before UI** | SDK-HOME-01..03 |
| **PR-1** | Shell brand `/` + Hero + CSS migration §8.3 + i18n profiles | — | HOME-UNIT-02, G-P6-UI-07 |
| **PR-2** | Latest tours block + fail-soft fetch §3.4 | — | HOME-UNIT-03, HOME-UNIT-04 |
| **PR-3** | Trust + Final CTA + smoke multi-project + guard-home-hooks + CI | cutover | HOME-01..06 |

### 15.1 PR review checklist

```text
[ ] resolveGuestLandingFeatures — zero pluginId literals in apps/marketing
[ ] no @app-tour/workspace-* import in apps/marketing/src (eslint)
[ ] hooks match §8.1 + marketing-catalog-ui.md
[ ] home.full vs home.minimal i18n isolation
[ ] CSS: no header[data-marketing-home-header] in new markup
[ ] denali-marketing.css scoped; urban unchanged for full blocks
[ ] no fake stats · no "featured" curation copy
[ ] reduced-motion respected
[ ] mother host untouched
[ ] generate:workspace-registry run if manifest touched
```

