    "blogTeaser": false
  },
  "i18nProfile": "minimal"
}
```

**PR-5 sections (2026-07-04):** `faq` · `footer` — hooks: `data-marketing-home-faq` · `data-marketing-footer` · `data-marketing-nav-drawer`.

**PR-6 sections (2026-07-04):** `whySection` · `journey` · `testimonials` — hooks: `data-marketing-home-why` · `-journey` · `-testimonials`. See [`marketing-landing-complete-plan.mdoc`](./marketing-landing-complete-plan.mdoc) PR-6.

**PR-7 sections (2026-07-04):** `featuredTours` · `featuredToursLimit` · `categories` · `destinations` · `heroSearch` — hooks: `data-marketing-home-featured` · `-categories` · `-destinations` · `-search`. Catalog fetch uses **one** fail-soft call with `limit = max(latestToursLimit, featuredToursLimit, 12 when categories)`; featured uses **same catalog sort** as latest (R10 — no curation API). Categories derive from card `category` field; `/tours?category=` filters client-side post-fetch. Destinations are static i18n seed until exposure API exists. Hero search is GET `/tours?q=` (Urban may also pass `city` when list features allow).

**denali PR-7 manifest excerpt:**

```json
"featuredTours": true,
"featuredToursLimit": 3,
"categories": true,
"destinations": true,
"heroSearch": true
```

**urban · guest-club:** all PR-7 booleans `false`, `featuredToursLimit: 0`.

**Page order (full):** Hero (+ search) → Featured → Latest → Categories → Destinations → Trust → Why → Journey → Testimonials → Gallery → FAQ → Equipment → (Blog) → Final CTA · Footer in shell.

**PR-8 sections (2026-07-04):** `gallery` · `equipment` · `blogTeaser` — hooks: `data-marketing-home-gallery` · `-equipment` · `-blog`. Shell: `data-marketing-skip-link`. Home JSON-LD: `ItemList` on `/` when catalog items present (WebSite remains in layout). Gallery photos = unique `coverImageUrl` from catalog fetch (no media API). Equipment = static i18n checklist. Blog gated off until CMS (`blogTeaser: false` on denali). Per-tenant hero: optional `marketingHeroUrl` on branding snapshot → CSS `--mkt-hero-image`. Lighthouse CI collects `/` + `/tours`.

**denali PR-8 manifest excerpt:**

```json
"gallery": true,
"equipment": true,
"blogTeaser": false
```

Extend `guestSeo.marketing`:

```json
"homeTitleKey": "seo.homeTitle",
"homeDescriptionKey": "seo.homeDescription"
```

### 18.2 Generator output

`scripts/generate-workspace-registry.mjs` emits:

```text
packages/workspace-sdk/src/catalog/workspace-guest-landing.generated.ts
```

Regenerate: `pnpm run generate:workspace-registry`

### 18.3 Resolver

File: `packages/workspace-sdk/src/catalog/resolve-guest-landing-features.ts`

```typescript
export type GuestLandingVariant = "full" | "minimal";

export type GuestLandingFeatures = Readonly<{
  readonly variant: GuestLandingVariant;
  readonly sections: Readonly<{
    readonly hero: boolean;
    readonly latestTours: boolean;
    readonly latestToursLimit: number;
    readonly trust: boolean;
    readonly finalCta: boolean;
    readonly faq: boolean;
    readonly footer: boolean;
    readonly whySection: boolean;
    readonly journey: boolean;
    readonly testimonials: boolean;
    readonly featuredTours: boolean;
    readonly featuredToursLimit: number;
    readonly categories: boolean;
    readonly destinations: boolean;
    readonly heroSearch: boolean;
    readonly gallery: boolean;
    readonly equipment: boolean;
    readonly blogTeaser: boolean;
  }>;
  readonly i18nProfile: "full" | "minimal";
}>;

export function resolveGuestLandingFeatures(
  pluginId: WorkspacePluginId | string
): GuestLandingFeatures;
```

Throws `UnknownGuestLandingPluginError` (`GUEST_LANDING_NOT_CONFIGURED`) when manifest missing — same ergonomics as catalog list features.

