|----|--------|
| SDK-HOME-01 | denali → full all sections true, limit 6 |
| SDK-HOME-02 | urban → minimal all sections false |
| SDK-HOME-03 | unknown pluginId → throws |
| HOME-UNIT-06 | PR-7 discovery section gates + hooks |
| HOME-UNIT-07 | `/tours` client-side q/category filter |
| HOME-UNIT-08 | PR-8 gallery/equipment gates + home JSON-LD + hero override |

