### 18.6 Generator implementation (PR-0 file list)

Mirror [`generateWorkspaceCatalogListFeatures`](../../../scripts/generate-workspace-registry.mjs):

| Step | File / symbol | Action |
|------|---------------|--------|
| 1 | `GUEST_EXTENSION_MANIFEST_KEYS` | Add `"guestLanding"` |
| 2 | `assertGuestLandingManifest(manifest)` | Validate `variant`, `sections`, `i18nProfile` |
| 3 | `generateWorkspaceGuestLanding(manifests)` | Emit registry object |
| 4 | `OUTPUT_PATHS.guestLanding` | `packages/workspace-sdk/src/catalog/workspace-guest-landing.generated.ts` |
| 5 | `generateAll()` / `writeGenerated()` | Wire guestLanding output |
| 6 | `assertGuestSeoManifest` | Optional `homeTitleKey`, `homeDescriptionKey` on `guestSeo.marketing` |
| 7 | `generateWorkspaceGuestSeo` | Extend `WorkspaceGuestSeoMarketing` type with `homeTitleKey?`, `homeDescriptionKey?` |
| 8 | `packages/workspace-sdk/src/catalog/resolve-guest-landing-features.ts` | Resolver + `UnknownGuestLandingPluginError` |
| 9 | `packages/workspace-sdk/src/public-api.ts` | Export resolver + types |
| 10 | `product-neutral-core.contract.spec.ts` | Allowlist new resolver path |
| 11 | `pnpm run generate:workspace-registry` | Commit generated files |

**`assertGuestLandingManifest` rules:**

```text
guestLanding.variant ∈ { "full", "minimal" }
guestLanding.i18nProfile ∈ { "full", "minimal" }
sections.hero, latestTours, trust, finalCta — boolean
sections.latestToursLimit — integer ≥ 0
When variant === "minimal" → all section flags must be false, limit === 0
When variant === "full" → hero + trust + finalCta true; latestToursLimit 1..12
```

**Generated shape:**

```typescript
export const WORKSPACE_GUEST_LANDING: Readonly<
  Record<string, Readonly<GuestLandingFeatures>>
> = Object.freeze({
  denali: Object.freeze({ variant: "full", sections: { ... }, i18nProfile: "full" }),
  urban: Object.freeze({ variant: "minimal", sections: { ... }, i18nProfile: "minimal" }),
  "guest-club": Object.freeze({ ... }),
});
```

### 18.7 Manifest requiredness

| Workspace | `guestLanding` |
|-----------|----------------|
| denali, urban, guest-club | **Required** before PR-0 merge |
| Any manifest with `catalogPresentation` | **Required** (guest-capable) |
| L0 starter without catalog | Optional until marketing surface ships |
| `workspace:create --guest` scaffold | Must emit `guestLanding: minimal` stub — see [ADR-GP-005](../../dev/adr-guest-plugin/ADR-GP-005-guest-landing-manifest.md) |

