| 4 | Verify `resolveGuestLandingFeatures("{id}")` in SDK unit test |
| 5 | Add marketing smoke when product-ready (SMK-MKT-HOME-05 pattern for isolation) |
| 6 | Document hooks in marketing-catalog-ui.md if new variant added |

**Do not** add `if (pluginId === "{id}")` in `apps/marketing`.


